  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">The aelkhazak bore many weapons used to fight at both land and sea. You gain access to all uncommon weapons with the aelkhazak trait. You gain familiarity with aelkhazak weapons and the trident, asp coil, the breaching pike, and urumi. In addition, you gain access to all uncommon aelkhazak weapons – for the purpose of determining your proficiency, you treat any of these that are martial weapons as simple weapons and advanced weapons as martial weapons.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">At 5th level, whenever you get a critical hit with one of these weapons, you get its critical specialization effect.</span></p>"
